12
00:00:46.708 --> 00:00:49.666
-[gunshot echoes]
-[sirens. music fade]

13
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:51.791
[indistinct chatter]

14
00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.833
-[gentle music playing]
-[dog barking faintly]

15
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:01.666
-Hey. Chiquinho.
-[Chiquinho] Morning. Stomper.

16
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:09.208
[music turns uplifting]

17
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:11.333
Morning. João. Is this mine?

18
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:12.708
Thanks. man.

19
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:18.500
Raimundo!
When are you going to train. Raimundo?

20
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:19.708
Just do it.

