[music turns edgy]

23
00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.333
[dry thuds]

24
00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:47.833
[breathing in deeply]

25
00:01:58.333 --> 00:01:59.333
[sighs]

26
00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:02.875
[girl shouts] Hurry up. Toni!

27
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:04.666
Come on!

28
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:07.000
[music fades]

29
00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:10.166
[gentle music returns]

30
00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.250
[music turns unsettling]

31
00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:32.416
Toni!

32
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.458
Come over here. Hurry!

33
00:02:36.875 --> 00:02:39.916
Step away. Paulina. step away!
Just back up. Back up. please.

34
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:56.208
[music turns ominous]

35
00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.833
-[gasps]
-[grunts]

36
00:03:00.916 --> 00:03:03.458
[frenzied theme music playing]

37
00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:10.833
WRATH

38
00:03:10.916 --> 00:03:12.333
Focus on the fight. Júnior!

39
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.541
[taunting laugh]

40
00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:17.375
[crowd roars]

41
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.583
Gotta raise your guard. man!

42
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.125
-Come on!
-You're a bitch.

43
00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:23.708
[Toni] Gotta fight back!

44
00:03:24.791 --> 00:03:27.458
-[crowd chants] Malamute! Malamute!
-[taunting laugh]

45
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:29.000
[crowd continues] Malamute!

46
00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:31.000
[music stops]

47
00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:34.416
[crowd chant echoes]

48
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.750
ADDRESS: FRANCISCO LOPES. 313

49
00:03:37.291 --> 00:03:39.291
[distant sirens]

50
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:42.875
[ominous music playing]

51
00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:02.333
[Paulina] Hey. There's no one in there.

52
00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:14.166
Are you looking for Toni?

53
00:04:15.041 --> 00:04:16.208
Antônio Trindade.

54
00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:19.333
-Know where he is?
-At Malamute's fight.

55
00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:24.041
Don't play around. Don't lose focus.

56
00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:25.375
[electronic funk music playing]

57
00:04:25.958 --> 00:04:27.083
You're weak!

58
00:04:27.666 --> 00:04:29.000
[Toni] Yeah. Nice. kid!

59
00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:31.958
You're a fucking loser.
No way you're winning this fight.

60
00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:36.791
[crowd roars]

61
00:04:37.583 --> 00:04:39.291
[growls] Come on. dammit!

62
00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:40.750
You got him angry.

63
00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:43.458
[grunts]

64
00:04:45.875 --> 00:04:48.333
[Toni] Spin. spin! Yeah. that's it!

65
00:04:48.416 --> 00:04:49.958
[coach] That's it. kid!

66
00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:52.250
-Let's go.
-[Toni] Nah. why'd you get up?

67
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:53.875
Finish him. Come on!

68
00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:55.291
He's taking too many risks.

69
00:05:00.916 --> 00:05:02.458
[crowd roars]

70
00:05:02.541 --> 00:05:04.041
[crowd chanting] Now you're dead!

71
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:05.708
Now you're dead!

72
00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:09.041
Now you're dead! Now you're dead!

73
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.833
It's okay. He got him
when he was getting up. Goddamn.

74
00:05:13.541 --> 00:05:15.375
[howling]

75
00:05:15.916 --> 00:05:18.041
[Malamute] That's right!
I'm the fucking best!

76
00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:19.750
This is fucking Trindade!

77
00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:22.708
[whooping]

78
00:05:22.791 --> 00:05:25.333
-Good job. Júnior. Nice fight.
-[Malamute] Trindade. that's right!

79
00:05:25.416 --> 00:05:28.750
I am Malamute!
Fuck. yeah! Trindade for life!

80
00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:31.750
Alright. Júnior. that's enough.
Knock it off.

81
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:32.666
Get down.

82
00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.541
-[Malamute growls]
-[Toni] Nice fight.

83
00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:36.250
What's wrong. Coach? I fucking won.

84
00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:38.333
So tell me. were you fighting alone?

85
00:05:38.416 --> 00:05:39.875
-Go pay your respects.
-[grunts]

86
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:42.166
Dammit. pay your respects
to your opponent.

87
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.166
Tank!

88
00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.250
-Nice fight. Good job.
-[Tank] Thanks a lot. Good to see you.

89
00:05:46.333 --> 00:05:50.583
-[Toni] Take it easy.
-[crowd chanting] Malamute! Malamute!

90
00:05:52.833 --> 00:05:54.875
Act like a champion. You hear me?

91
00:05:54.958 --> 00:05:56.791
Let me be one. fuck.

92
00:05:56.875 --> 00:05:59.625
Why won't you let me fight Neco?
Let me take that guy.

93
00:05:59.708 --> 00:06:01.458
Because fighting is here and here.

94
00:06:02.041 --> 00:06:03.375
And here and here.

95
00:06:03.458 --> 00:06:07.416
I need you to understand.
Then you can fight anyone you want.

96
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.375
Over here. Júnior.

97
00:06:09.458 --> 00:06:12.208
What a great fight. Malamute!
Fantastic stuff.

98
00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:13.916
You're coming for the belt. right?

99
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.666
Yeah. you bet I'm coming for the belt.
I'll be the new champion. Tell everybody.

100
00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:21.250
And yo. everybody with a phone.
go on. start recording.

101
00:06:21.333 --> 00:06:22.791
Yeah. whip it out right now.

102
00:06:22.875 --> 00:06:25.000
Film everything and post it.

103
00:06:25.083 --> 00:06:28.125
Neco the Thrasher. you're on my list. 'k?

104
00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:29.833
You're gonna get the thrashing.

105
00:06:29.916 --> 00:06:31.958
-I'll kick your ass.
-Alright. Stomper. He's a kid.

106
00:06:32.041 --> 00:06:33.625
He's impossible is what he is.

107
00:06:33.708 --> 00:06:35.541
Yeah. that's right. Malamute!

108
00:06:35.625 --> 00:06:36.916
[microphone screech]

109
00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.958
[crowd chanting] Malamute! Malamute!

110
00:06:41.041 --> 00:06:43.208
[presenter] There you have it. The winner.

111
00:06:46.458 --> 00:06:47.708
You're hot!

112
00:06:47.791 --> 00:06:50.541
Babe! You saw? You saw me win?

113
00:06:51.375 --> 00:06:53.791
Yeah! I crossed the whole city
to come see you.

114
00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:55.500
-I drained the Tank!
-[chuckles]

115
00:06:58.916 --> 00:07:00.541
Hey. great fight. Malamute.

116
00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:03.458
I know how to take a loss when it's fair.

117
00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:06.583
Thanks. Mrs. Yana.
Sorry I hurt your fighter. I was just…

118
00:07:06.666 --> 00:07:09.500
No problem. it's fine.
You were just doing your job.

119
00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:11.291
-Let's go.
-No hard feelings.

120
00:07:11.375 --> 00:07:13.375
Hey. when do I get to see you fight again?

121
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:16.458
I remember your hammer kick. Incredible.

122
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:17.833
We miss your fights.

123
00:07:17.916 --> 00:07:19.250
-Thank you.
-Come on.

124
00:07:20.375 --> 00:07:21.500
[sighs]

125
00:07:22.416 --> 00:07:23.458
[Yana] Toni…

126
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:25.583
Congrats.

127
00:07:28.125 --> 00:07:29.166
[Toni grunts]

128
00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.083
[indistinct chatter]

129
00:07:42.416 --> 00:07:44.416
[ominous music playing]

130
00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.416
[man] Catch you later. man. take care.

131
00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.875
[coach] Stomper. Take it easy!

132
00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:55.458
-All good. man.
-Hey. there's Toni. Go talk to the guy.

133
00:07:56.375 --> 00:07:57.958
You ran away from the hospital?

134
00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:00.708
What do you want from me?

135
00:08:00.791 --> 00:08:02.125
I wanna say thanks.

136
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.500
-The doctor said you saved my life.
-No need to.

137
00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:07.666
And you should thank the doctor and God.

138
00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.625
Hey. man. you took a bullet
right in the head. You shoulda croaked.

139
00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.833
Alright. man. see you later.

140
00:08:13.416 --> 00:08:14.250
God bless you.

141
00:08:14.333 --> 00:08:16.916
Do you know who I am? Marcelo Lazarus.

142
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.625
You wrote that when you filled this out.

143
00:08:18.708 --> 00:08:20.291
You don't know your own name?

144
00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:21.291
No.

145
00:08:23.166 --> 00:08:24.583
Did you lose your memory?

146
00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:32.083
Okay…

147
00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:33.666
You listen here.

148
00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:35.833
I thought someone
had dumped a corpse in the landfill.

149
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:38.833
Turns out it was you.
You kept repeating that name.

150
00:08:38.916 --> 00:08:39.875
Marcelo.

151
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:42.875
Lazarus. I wrote it in
because it comes from the Bible.

152
00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:44.541
You were as good as dead. man.

153
00:08:47.416 --> 00:08:49.125
I honor God through my actions.

154
00:08:49.208 --> 00:08:51.083
That's why I took you outta there.

155
00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:56.250
[somber music continues]

156
00:08:57.791 --> 00:08:59.041
May God light your way. son.

157
00:09:03.791 --> 00:09:06.708
[music intensifies. fades]

158
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:15.458
TRINDADE FIGHT ACADEMY

159
00:09:17.416 --> 00:09:19.416
[fan whirring]

160
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:28.208
BIBLE

161
00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:31.458
[Toni] "Commit thy way unto the Lord."

162
00:09:32.916 --> 00:09:34.833
"Trust also in Him."

163
00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:39.000
"And He shall answer."

164
00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:42.125
[somber music resumes]

165
00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.041
[inhales shakily]

166
00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:12.250
MUNICIPAL HOSPITAL

167
00:10:16.458 --> 00:10:18.458
[seagulls squawking]

168
00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.500
[somber music continues]

169
00:10:51.208 --> 00:10:54.541
PATIENT: MARCELO LAZARUS

170
00:10:54.625 --> 00:10:56.208
[Toni] Morning. Laércio!

171
00:10:56.291 --> 00:10:57.458
[Laércio] Morning!

172
00:10:57.541 --> 00:10:59.166
FIGHTING GYM

173
00:10:59.833 --> 00:11:01.833
[bangs. thuds]

174
00:11:21.791 --> 00:11:23.750
[upbeat samba music playing]

175
00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:25.583
What's going on. Olívia?

176
00:11:25.666 --> 00:11:30.291
There he is! There's the winner.
Morning. How are ya doing?

177
00:11:30.375 --> 00:11:32.500
-Hiya doing. All good?
-[Olívia laughs]

178
00:11:32.583 --> 00:11:34.625
Saw the video. Nice going.

179
00:11:35.416 --> 00:11:38.333
Yeah. man. the guy thought
he'd beat you. You showed him.

180
00:11:38.416 --> 00:11:40.791
-That was nice.
-Yeah. well my head is pounding like hell.

181
00:11:41.291 --> 00:11:44.333
So you can dish it out
but you can't take it. Malamute.

182
00:11:44.416 --> 00:11:46.583
-[scoffs] Just a hungover. That's all.
-[Olívia] Ha!

183
00:11:46.666 --> 00:11:49.250
Partied hard. you know?
I should get to enjoy myself.

184
00:11:49.333 --> 00:11:50.541
-Am I right?
-Yeah. sure.

185
00:11:50.625 --> 00:11:53.208
To be honest. should take the day off.

186
00:11:53.291 --> 00:11:56.125
I know your coach
and he won't go easy on you if you do.

187
00:11:56.208 --> 00:11:59.958
'Cause MMA is serious business.
You represent Trindade. don't forget.

188
00:12:00.041 --> 00:12:00.958
-Yeah.
-[phone ringing]

189
00:12:01.041 --> 00:12:02.833
You go ahead.
I really gotta take this call.

190
00:12:02.916 --> 00:12:05.625
-Come train though.
-Sure. I'll see you there later.

191
00:12:06.541 --> 00:12:08.166
-You listen. Júnior.
-[ringing continues]

192
00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.833
If you hurt my friend. you'll regret it.

193
00:12:11.708 --> 00:12:12.833
So. watch it.

194
00:12:14.541 --> 00:12:17.166
-Don't you think of it.
-[ringing continues]

195
00:12:20.083 --> 00:12:21.166
Mrs. Yana.

196
00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:23.750
[Yana] I'd like us
to keep the conversation going.

197
00:12:23.833 --> 00:12:27.041
I'd like to work with you.
to boost your career.

198
00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:28.541
Uh…

199
00:12:28.625 --> 00:12:30.333
I don't know. I'm still thinking.

200
00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:33.208
Júnior. listen.
It's take it or leave it. alright?

201
00:12:36.208 --> 00:12:38.333
-[upbeat samba music playing]
-[horn toots]

202
00:12:38.416 --> 00:12:40.083
♪ Inside my X1 ♪

203
00:12:40.166 --> 00:12:42.166
-[hearty chuckle]
-♪ Inside my X1 ♪

204
00:12:43.583 --> 00:12:44.750
Yeah. yeah.

205
00:12:44.833 --> 00:12:47.333
Hey. Olívia! He finally won!

206
00:12:47.416 --> 00:12:49.458
See that?
Did you see the fight last night?

207
00:12:49.541 --> 00:12:50.916
-Morning. how are ya?
-Morning.

208
00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.291
[coach] Nice shades! Lovely.

209
00:12:52.375 --> 00:12:54.416
-Thanks. found a great vendor.
-[coach laughs]

210
00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.041
-You guys are early for a change.
-[driver] Yeah. I guess so.

211
00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:01.166
Good morning!

212
00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.250
[Toni] Hey!

213
00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.708
Good morning. Master!

214
00:13:04.791 --> 00:13:06.916
-[Toni] Morning.
-[Olívia chuckles]

215
00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.333
[Toni] Good morning.

216
00:13:09.166 --> 00:13:11.291
[Olívia] Good morning. Coach.

217
00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:15.291
-So I heard Malamute won?
-[Toni] Yeah. you heard that?

218
00:13:15.375 --> 00:13:16.500
Showed him how we do it!

219
00:13:16.583 --> 00:13:19.416
That was yesterday.
Get over it. Today is another day.

220
00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.916
Back to training.
We don't want you getting soft.

221
00:13:22.958 --> 00:13:25.125
I'm serious.
If you want a cuddle. get a puppy.

222
00:13:25.208 --> 00:13:26.333
Come on. fight. dammit!

223
00:13:26.416 --> 00:13:27.541
[coach] That's it. Nice.

224
00:13:27.625 --> 00:13:30.333
Create space. come on.
Make room. Catolé! Fuck's sake.

225
00:13:30.416 --> 00:13:32.708
Hey kid. your stance is awful. Come on.

226
00:13:32.791 --> 00:13:34.833
[coach] That's it. Underneath.
You gotta block that.

227
00:13:34.916 --> 00:13:37.208
-[Toni] That's it. that's it!
-[coach] You gotta be quick.

228
00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.583
[Toni] Keep moving. keep it up.
Leg. legs! Yes! That's it. Nice.

229
00:13:41.666 --> 00:13:43.375
-Hello!
-[coach] That's it.

230
00:13:44.125 --> 00:13:45.500
-[woman] Hey. Dad.
-[coach] Good!

231
00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:47.000
Hey. sweetheart.

232
00:13:47.083 --> 00:13:49.333
-[coach] That's it. She's bigger than you.
-Hey!

233
00:13:49.416 --> 00:13:52.458
-Look at me. You gotta raise that elbow.
-[woman] You got this. Olívia!

234
00:13:52.541 --> 00:13:54.875
[coach] Don't let her body-lock you.
Defend yourself! Yes!

235
00:13:54.958 --> 00:13:58.291
Don't give her any space.
Quick. You gotta move fast.

236
00:13:58.375 --> 00:13:59.750
How's it going?

237
00:13:59.833 --> 00:14:01.708
As usual. Rushing around.

238
00:14:06.083 --> 00:14:08.708
Hey. sweetie. Where's your boyfriend?

239
00:14:09.958 --> 00:14:11.083
Can't find your fighter?

240
00:14:11.166 --> 00:14:13.750
-This look like a daycare to you?
-He's not my responsibility.

241
00:14:13.833 --> 00:14:15.833
I only have one child.
That's one too many.

242
00:14:15.916 --> 00:14:19.041
-Where is he? Lunchtime!
-[Olívia] Time to eat. guys.

243
00:14:19.125 --> 00:14:20.083
Give me a minute. okay?

244
00:14:21.416 --> 00:14:23.791
Hey. Gabi. where's my stew at? This one?

245
00:14:23.875 --> 00:14:25.166
-Yeah.
-Got chicken?

246
00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:26.750
No. not today. sorry.

247
00:14:26.833 --> 00:14:28.458
Whose blood is that there?

248
00:14:32.125 --> 00:14:34.375
Whose damn blood is that?

249
00:14:37.416 --> 00:14:38.500
Catolé.

250
