Get some sleep.

500
00:27:58.875 --> 00:27:59.750
It's late.

501
00:28:03.833 --> 00:28:06.500
Hey. I know you were
trying to help me earlier.

502
00:28:08.500 --> 00:28:09.583
But forget about it.

503
00:28:11.416 --> 00:28:13.666
It's not worth fighting over. okay?

504
00:28:16.375 --> 00:28:18.375
[footsteps fade]

505
00:28:20.041 --> 00:28:21.750
[Toni] Forgetting sometimes is a blessing.

506
00:28:28.958 --> 00:28:30.791
[knocking]

507
00:28:30.875 --> 00:28:32.583
[Olívia] Hello! Good morning!

508
00:28:32.666 --> 00:28:34.083
[Catolé] Morning. boss!

509
00:28:35.750 --> 00:28:37.000
[insistent knocking]

510
00:28:38.083 --> 00:28:40.208
-[Catolé] Open up!
-[insistent banging]

511
00:28:40.291 --> 00:28:41.583
[Marcelo groans]

512
00:28:42.375 --> 00:28:43.916
-[Catolé] Hello?
-[knocking]

513
00:28:59.750 --> 00:29:01.125
[Olívia] Good morning!

514
00:29:02.458 --> 00:29:04.833
For those of you who don't know.
this is Marcelo.

515
00:29:04.916 --> 00:29:06.375
I'm the one who cut his hair.

516
00:29:06.458 --> 00:29:08.500
Let's get this day started. Come on. guys.

517
00:29:08.583 --> 00:29:10.041
Wait. Who is that guy?

518
00:29:10.125 --> 00:29:12.125
No idea. He's been around here.
You didn't notice?

519
00:29:12.208 --> 00:29:13.250
Whoa!

520
00:29:13.333 --> 00:29:15.333
-Girl. damn. you have magic hands.
-Of course I do.

521
00:29:15.416 --> 00:29:18.166
I can do some magic on your face too.
Don't test me.

522
00:29:19.083 --> 00:29:21.416
-What the fuck?
-[edgy music playing]

523
00:29:21.500 --> 00:29:22.875
[Catolé] What happened?

524
00:29:23.750 --> 00:29:26.166
There's no mat. no bag.
What's going on here?

525
00:29:26.250 --> 00:29:28.208
Yeah. and BOB. Where's BOB?

526
00:29:28.958 --> 00:29:30.875
Do you know anything about this?

527
00:29:32.791 --> 00:29:34.333
[sighs. clicks teeth]

528
00:29:34.916 --> 00:29:37.291
Alright. well since you're here.
give me a hand.

529
00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:39.583
We'll grab the old punching bag.

530
00:29:39.666 --> 00:29:40.583
Come on.

531
00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:45.666
Listen. brother. you should stick with me.

532
00:29:45.750 --> 00:29:48.583
I'm the top dog here at Trindade. alright?

533
00:29:48.666 --> 00:29:49.666
You a champion?

534
00:29:50.666 --> 00:29:53.500
Um. no. But I think
you know Malamute. Malamute.

535
00:29:53.583 --> 00:29:54.583
Yeah.

536
00:29:54.666 --> 00:29:56.375
Well. I'm a better fighter.

537
00:29:56.458 --> 00:29:57.958
I think Júnior'd like to know that.

538
00:29:58.041 --> 00:30:01.166
-How about I tell him?
-Shit! Don't you make jokes about that.

539
00:30:06.250 --> 00:30:08.791
-Hey. sorry I'm late. Good morning.
-[Olívia] Good morning.

540
00:30:08.875 --> 00:30:11.041
Morning. Coach! Tell us the truth.

541
00:30:11.583 --> 00:30:13.583
You had a fire sale yesterday?

542
00:30:13.666 --> 00:30:15.458
How about you stop talking
and start training?

543
00:30:15.541 --> 00:30:17.250
How do we do that without any equipment?

544
00:30:17.333 --> 00:30:19.208
I found this old thing in the back.

545
00:30:19.291 --> 00:30:21.250
You got legs. right?

546
00:30:21.333 --> 00:30:22.666
And arms as well. son?

547
00:30:22.750 --> 00:30:24.000
So quit whining.

548
00:30:24.083 --> 00:30:25.458
And get to work.

549
00:30:26.625 --> 00:30:28.166
What's up. family?

550
00:30:28.666 --> 00:30:31.125
Look what I found.
This old punching dummy.

551
00:30:31.208 --> 00:30:34.250
-The so-called BOB.
-[Olívia] Did it have to be that ugly?

552
00:30:34.333 --> 00:30:35.166
It's ugly.

553
00:30:35.250 --> 00:30:36.166
It's hideous.

554
00:30:36.250 --> 00:30:37.958
Then it'll be easier to beat. Look.

555
00:30:38.041 --> 00:30:41.416
-Where the hell is Malamute?
-Maybe they took him with your stuff.

556
00:30:41.916 --> 00:30:44.375
Can't catch a break. for fuck's sakes.

557
00:30:44.458 --> 00:30:46.666
Alright. get the old mat out here then.

558
00:30:46.750 --> 00:30:50.666
Hey. since you're here. son.
you might as well give us a hand. right?

559
00:30:51.625 --> 00:30:52.583
Thanks.

560
00:30:53.541 --> 00:30:56.000
[edgy fun music playing]

561
00:31:01.541 --> 00:31:02.791
[Catolé hissing]

562
00:31:11.250 --> 00:31:12.750
Are you starving or something?

563
00:31:13.291 --> 00:31:15.083
Why aren't you
punching the bag any harder?

564
00:31:15.166 --> 00:31:18.375
With all due respect. Coach.
it's way too old to use.

565
00:31:18.458 --> 00:31:20.208
If I punch it. it'll explode.

566
00:31:20.291 --> 00:31:23.041
Then destroy it. goddammit!
Punch it for real!

567
00:31:24.208 --> 00:31:25.125
[violent thud]

568
00:31:26.916 --> 00:31:27.750
Harder!

569
00:31:27.833 --> 00:31:29.416
Come on!

570
00:31:33.750 --> 00:31:34.666
[Toni clears throat]

571
00:31:38.666 --> 00:31:39.666
Don't laugh.

572
00:31:44.250 --> 00:31:47.708
[comic jazz twist]

573
00:31:51.166 --> 00:31:52.833
[upbeat jazz samba playing]

574
00:32:03.958 --> 00:32:06.125
[Hammer] Yeah. that's good.

575
00:32:06.208 --> 00:32:07.916
Looking light. Let it fall.

576
00:32:08.666 --> 00:32:09.541
Got it?

577
00:32:12.750 --> 00:32:15.833
[Toni] Off the ropes.
out of the corner. That's it.

578
00:32:16.416 --> 00:32:18.666
Stomper. hey. All good?

579
00:32:19.291 --> 00:32:21.666
You know. sometimes we get up
on the wrong foot.

580
00:32:22.500 --> 00:32:24.625
Don't worry. Stomper. It'll get better.

581
00:32:25.458 --> 00:32:27.666
-Let's go!
-Come on. guys. move it. Move it!

582
00:32:29.791 --> 00:32:32.000
-What's up. Dad?
-Hey. sweetie. How you doing?

583
00:32:32.083 --> 00:32:33.583
-You alright?
-[Gabi] Yeah.

584
00:32:34.958 --> 00:32:36.666
More movement. kid.

585
00:32:36.750 --> 00:32:37.583
Punch him!

586
00:32:38.250 --> 00:32:40.791
-Punch him! Two. one-two.
-What happened to all the equipment?

587
00:32:40.875 --> 00:32:41.916
[inhales]

588
00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:42.916
[sighs] Ah…

589
00:32:44.125 --> 00:32:47.541
Well. I had bills to pay.
That simple. So I sold some stuff.

590
00:32:47.625 --> 00:32:50.375
Just your dad
being your dad. I'll sort it out.

591
00:32:50.458 --> 00:32:52.833
Move! Fuck. lift your guard. please!

592
00:32:53.958 --> 00:32:56.416
What the hell you doing?
Didn't you hear him?

593
00:32:57.500 --> 00:32:59.041
-Keep moving.
-[Hammer] Hands up. dammit!

594
00:32:59.125 --> 00:33:01.125
-Dad. when that happens--
-[Toni] Nah. what is this?

595
00:33:01.208 --> 00:33:03.958
If you keep fighting like that.
you'll be a sack of potatoes.

596
00:33:04.041 --> 00:33:05.750
You'll get thrown right to the ground!

597
00:33:05.833 --> 00:33:07.708
-Wake up!
-Dad. look at me.

598
00:33:07.791 --> 00:33:10.666
When you've got these issues.
let me know. We can sort it together.

599
00:33:12.708 --> 00:33:14.750
[sighs] It's my problem. sweetheart.

600
00:33:14.833 --> 00:33:18.375
Could you cut me some slack today?
I'll sort this out.

601
00:33:18.458 --> 00:33:20.916
Malamute's got a fight soon.
Prize money is good.

602
00:33:21.000 --> 00:33:22.833
He's ready for it. He'll win.

603
00:33:23.916 --> 00:33:25.375
[sighs deeply]

604
00:33:29.166 --> 00:33:32.041
Well. Malamute's not
with Trindade anymore.

605
00:33:32.125 --> 00:33:34.375
Truth is. I saw him going into Alpha.

606
00:33:41.250 --> 00:33:43.250
[muffled buzzing]

607
00:33:51.458 --> 00:33:53.666
Hey! Cover for me. Hammer.

608
00:33:53.750 --> 00:33:55.041
You got it. Coach.

609
00:33:56.291 --> 00:33:58.791
-I can give you a ride--
-Don't follow me please!

610
00:34:03.750 --> 00:34:05.083
[thuds]

611
00:34:05.708 --> 00:34:06.916
[Alpha coach] Yes. good.

612
00:34:08.208 --> 00:34:09.750
Malamute!

613
00:34:16.166 --> 00:34:17.750
You enjoying your new gym?

614
00:34:19.958 --> 00:34:22.166
-I was gonna tell you.
-Yeah. I bet you were.

615
00:34:22.250 --> 00:34:23.750
I bet you were gonna tell me.

616
00:34:24.958 --> 00:34:26.291
When I started training you.

617
00:34:26.375 --> 00:34:29.291
you were 15.
and just skin and bone. like a twig.

618
00:34:29.833 --> 00:34:32.416
You thought you were a tough guy.
involved in drug dealing.

619
00:34:32.500 --> 00:34:34.166
You were headed for a wall.

620
00:34:35.791 --> 00:34:39.708
You think you did good?
Is this fair to you? Hmm?

621
00:34:40.791 --> 00:34:41.666
Is that it?

622
00:34:42.166 --> 00:34:45.875
I signed you up for a fight. Malamute.
People are depending on you.

623
00:34:47.291 --> 00:34:49.791
I don't know how you sleep at night.
you fucking traitor.

624
00:34:49.875 --> 00:34:50.916
I'm not a traitor. Toni.

625
00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:52.916
-Oh. no?
-No. I made a decision for me is all.

626
00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:55.833
For you. It's all you think about.
It's all about you.

627
00:34:55.916 --> 00:34:58.291
You ungrateful. selfish asshole.

628
00:34:58.375 --> 00:35:00.291
-What did you say?
-You're ungrateful. Ungrateful.

629
00:35:00.375 --> 00:35:01.833
-Ungrateful?
-That's what you are.

630
00:35:01.916 --> 00:35:02.750
-Yeah?
-Yeah.

631
00:35:02.833 --> 00:35:06.041
Oh. yeah? Was I ungrateful
when I took your wasted ass home

632
00:35:06.125 --> 00:35:08.708
all those times
you got totally hammered at the bar?

633
00:35:08.791 --> 00:35:10.625
And was I a dickhead

634
00:35:10.708 --> 00:35:13.625
all those times I took care
of your daughter when she was sick?

635
00:35:13.708 --> 00:35:15.791
-You failed even as a father. fuck.
-You shut your…

636
00:35:15.875 --> 00:35:17.041
No. I'm speaking the truth!

637
00:35:17.125 --> 00:35:20.375
-Shut your fucking mouth!
-What the fuck are you gonna do. huh?

638
00:35:20.458 --> 00:35:22.625
If we fight right now.
I'll crush your fucking ass.

639
00:35:22.708 --> 00:35:24.791
-You drunken old fool!
-Watch it--

640
00:35:25.791 --> 00:35:27.166
[breathing heavily]

641
00:35:30.666 --> 00:35:31.708
Go for it!

642
00:35:33.166 --> 00:35:34.625
Go for it. fuck!

643
00:35:35.208 --> 00:35:37.208
[breathing heavily]

644
00:35:41.125 --> 00:35:42.791
You're not a kid anymore.

645
00:35:43.625 --> 00:35:46.375
You're a grown-ass man now.
You know what you're doing.

646
00:35:48.250 --> 00:35:50.250
You think you got me angry at you?

647
00:35:51.916 --> 00:35:53.875
You think I'm fucking upset with you?

648
00:35:54.500 --> 00:35:55.333
No!

649
00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:57.791
No. I'm upset with myself!

650
00:35:58.416 --> 00:36:01.208
'Cause I didn't raise you
to be a man. I failed you.

651
00:36:01.291 --> 00:36:04.833
Your values are awful.
You've got no honor as a fighter.

652
00:36:04.916 --> 00:36:06.541
So I'm angry with me!

653
00:36:07.166 --> 00:36:09.375
I came to look you in the eyes.

654
00:36:09.958 --> 00:36:11.416
And to bless you.

655
00:36:11.916 --> 00:36:13.791
Okay? It's fine. You live your life.

656
00:36:13.875 --> 00:36:16.333
I won't get in your way.
don't worry. Okay?

657
00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:18.875
I hope to God things go well for you.

658
00:36:19.958 --> 00:36:22.291
May God watch over you
and light your path.

659
00:36:25.541 --> 00:36:27.208
[shaky breathing. inhales]

660
00:36:30.041 --> 00:36:31.166
[whispers] And you…

661
00:36:33.791 --> 00:36:35.958
You are exactly like your father.

662
00:36:40.541 --> 00:36:41.750
[drumroll]

663
00:36:42.583 --> 00:36:44.958
[Hammer] You gotta move.
Don't leave your head still.

664
00:36:45.041 --> 00:36:46.875
[edgy jazz music playing]

665
00:36:46.958 --> 00:36:48.666
[Hammer] Movement is the secret.

666
00:36:50.041 --> 00:36:52.000
Your target's easy to hit.

667
00:36:54.041 --> 00:36:57.416
-Good job. kid.
-[Catolé chuckles] Look at the newbie.

668
00:36:57.500 --> 00:37:00.000
Think you're a big shot already. huh?

669
00:37:00.083 --> 00:37:04.125
Let's partner. You in?
Five minutes. We'll take it easy. alright?

670
00:37:05.083 --> 00:37:07.250
Catolé. will you leave him alone?

671
00:37:07.333 --> 00:37:09.291
Don't worry. Olívia. I'll go easy.

672
00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:10.875
Come on!

673
00:37:11.416 --> 00:37:12.416
Get up here.

674
00:37:13.666 --> 00:37:17.833
Come on up! Am I talking to a wall
or something? Let's go.

675
00:37:18.333 --> 00:37:20.416
Hey. I'll give you an advantage.

676
00:37:21.458 --> 00:37:22.875
A hand behind my back. okay?

677
00:37:23.458 --> 00:37:25.333
-Are you ready?
-Don't hurt him. alright?

678
00:37:25.416 --> 00:37:27.375
Don't worry. man. It won't hurt at all.

679
00:37:28.125 --> 00:37:28.958
Fight!

680
00:37:31.000 --> 00:37:32.916
Good one. Stay sharp. bro.

681
00:37:33.000 --> 00:37:34.541
[Hammer] Raise those hands!

682
00:37:35.333 --> 00:37:36.458
[Catolé] Yeah. that's it.

683
00:37:38.375 --> 00:37:39.458
Come to the middle.

684
00:37:40.250 --> 00:37:41.750
-[Olívia] Goddamn!
-[Hammer] Catolé.

685
00:37:41.833 --> 00:37:44.750
Better use two hands
or you're fucked! [chuckles]

686
00:37:45.333 --> 00:37:47.125
-Sorry about that.
-[Catolé] Don't say sorry.

687
00:37:47.208 --> 00:37:48.166
Fight like a man.

688
00:37:49.708 --> 00:37:50.708
[crashing thud]

689
00:37:54.958 --> 00:37:56.000
That was damn good.

690
00:37:59.041 --> 00:38:00.041
What's wrong?

691
00:38:02.250 --> 00:38:04.250
You're dead. motherfucker.

692
00:38:05.291 --> 00:38:06.708
[Catolé groaning]

693
00:38:07.375 --> 00:38:08.791
-[Hammer] What?
-What was that?

694
00:38:08.875 --> 00:38:12.708
[Olívia] Catolé. you're really dense. huh?
I told you not to fight the guy.

695
00:38:12.791 --> 00:38:15.333
[Hammer] What the hell. Catolé?
What's wrong with you?

696
00:38:15.958 --> 00:38:17.500
-[Catolé] My wrist…
-Pick yourself up.

697
00:38:17.583 --> 00:38:19.166
-Gabi. come out!
-[Catolé] Hurts bad.

698
00:38:19.250 --> 00:38:21.041
[Olívia] Fuck. it's broken.

699
00:38:22.291 --> 00:38:23.208
Why did you do that?

700
00:38:23.291 --> 00:38:24.125
[Catolé] Ow!

701
00:38:24.208 --> 00:38:26.083
-[Olívia] Calm down.
-[Gabi] Dammit. Catolé.

702
00:38:26.166 --> 00:38:28.458
My dad's gonna fucking kill you!

703
00:38:33.583 --> 00:38:35.166
[distant sirens]

704
00:38:57.916 --> 00:38:59.625
[sinister music playing]

705
00:39:13.916 --> 00:39:15.416
[panting heavily]

706
00:39:15.500 --> 00:39:17.083
[music intensifies]

707
00:39:20.875 --> 00:39:22.875
-[music fades]
-[heavy panting]

708
00:39:26.000 --> 00:39:27.750
[wolf whistle]

709
00:39:43.375 --> 00:39:44.375
You're ambidextrous?

710
00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:48.875
Hmm. First this. then the other.

711
00:39:48.958 --> 00:39:49.916
Got it?

712
00:39:50.750 --> 00:39:51.625
[Marcelo] Yeah.

713
00:39:52.208 --> 00:39:54.583
[Gabi] You're strong.
but you're pretty clumsy.

714
00:39:55.166 --> 00:39:57.875
I'll show you this.
just this once. It's simple.

715
00:39:58.875 --> 00:40:04.500
Jab. jab. dodge the straight.
cross. straight. uppercut.

716
00:40:05.791 --> 00:40:07.291
[rhythmic beat]

717
00:40:07.375 --> 00:40:08.750
Follow the rhythm.

718
00:40:08.833 --> 00:40:10.208
Firm stance. [gloves slam]

719
00:40:13.083 --> 00:40:15.375
Jab. jab. dodge the straight.

720
00:40:16.875 --> 00:40:17.750
Nice.

721
00:40:20.250 --> 00:40:21.083
Good.

722
00:40:23.541 --> 00:40:24.583
Firm stance.

723
00:40:25.875 --> 00:40:26.875
That's it.

724
00:40:28.541 --> 00:40:29.625
Go. Marcelo.

725
00:40:30.666 --> 00:40:31.500
Good!

726
00:40:33.208 --> 00:40:34.083
Nice.

727
00:40:35.750 --> 00:40:36.583
That's good.

728
00:40:39.333 --> 00:40:40.166
[Gabi laughs]

729
00:40:41.875 --> 00:40:42.916
[Marcelo grunts]

730
00:40:44.583 --> 00:40:45.791
[pants]

731
00:40:48.958 --> 00:40:50.041
You got it.

732
00:40:52.708 --> 00:40:53.666
Hmm.

733
00:40:54.625 --> 00:40:55.833
[emotive music playing]

734
00:40:56.708 --> 00:40:58.291
Ever break your nose?

735
00:41:00.500 --> 00:41:01.500
[grunts]

736
00:41:04.250 --> 00:41:06.416
You got that from a fight. right?

737
00:41:08.416 --> 00:41:09.958
I got one too. look.

738
00:41:10.666 --> 00:41:11.500
See that?

739
00:41:12.458 --> 00:41:13.375
[grunts]

740
00:41:16.166 --> 00:41:19.000
Hmm. But that wasn't from a fight though.

741
00:41:22.083 --> 00:41:23.166
You been lying?

742
00:41:27.333 --> 00:41:28.291
Who are you?

743
00:41:30.416 --> 00:41:31.833
And what are you doing here?

744
00:41:33.916 --> 00:41:36.208
-What are you after?
-[clank]

745
00:41:36.291 --> 00:41:38.750
He confuses fighting
with brawling. that's all.

746
00:41:40.333 --> 00:41:42.500
He wants to fight. but he's green.

747
00:41:43.291 --> 00:41:46.500
Well. even if he's green.
he still crushed Catolé sparring.

748
00:41:47.083 --> 00:41:48.416
I didn't mean to hurt him.

749
00:41:49.416 --> 00:41:50.458
[Toni] Hurt him how?

750
00:41:50.541 --> 00:41:53.958
No big deal. just the wrist…
It's really not too bad. A fracture…

751
00:41:54.041 --> 00:41:55.166
[Toni] His wrist?

752
00:41:55.750 --> 00:41:56.583
What?

753
00:41:57.375 --> 00:41:59.041
Just what I fucking needed.

754
00:41:59.125 --> 00:42:00.958
I thought it couldn't get any worse.

755
00:42:01.041 --> 00:42:03.875
Fuck me! I just lost
that asshole Malamute.

756
00:42:03.958 --> 00:42:06.291
Now I lose Catolé
because you were sparring?

757
00:42:06.875 --> 00:42:08.250
This is bullshit.

758
00:42:08.333 --> 00:42:10.541
Oh. I swear to God. [groans]

759
00:42:14.333 --> 00:42:15.500
Let me fight then.

760
00:42:17.458 --> 00:42:18.708
I'll replace Malamute.

761
00:42:20.416 --> 00:42:22.416
[gentle music playing]

762
00:42:24.583 --> 00:42:26.041
'Cause if I'm here right now.

763
00:42:27.458 --> 00:42:29.541
it's because God put me on your path.

764
00:42:29.625 --> 00:42:32.166
[Gabi] Dad. you missed it.
but you should've seen it.

765
00:42:32.250 --> 00:42:35.125
Catolé couldn't get a punch in.
This guy's got instinct and reflexes.

766
00:42:35.208 --> 00:42:38.125
He's clumsy for now.
with his legs mostly. We can fix that.

767
00:42:38.208 --> 00:42:40.208
The only thing I'm sure of
is I'm a fighter.

768
00:42:41.750 --> 00:42:43.333
Nah. he's not a fighter.

769
00:42:47.375 --> 00:42:49.583
I want you out of here by tomorrow.

770
00:42:50.625 --> 00:42:51.750
[music fades]

771
00:42:55.250 --> 00:42:57.625
Catolé's hurt.
Better not forget about that.

772
00:42:59.583 --> 00:43:01.291
His replacement's right here.

773
00:43:03.875 --> 00:43:05.041
Come on. get in.

774
00:43:07.208 --> 00:43:08.791
Come on. dude. let's get back to it.

775
00:43:11.083 --> 00:43:12.416
IF YOU'RE NOT A COACH.
NO ADVICE!

776
00:43:12.500 --> 00:43:15.458
[Toni] Watch it. That's it.
Good. Keep moving.

777
00:43:15.541 --> 00:43:16.375
[Catolé hissing]

778
00:43:16.458 --> 00:43:17.666
-[Toni] How you feeling?
-Fine.

779
00:43:18.333 --> 00:43:19.541
-Quicker. alright?
-Got it.

780
00:43:19.625 --> 00:43:20.541
Practice on me.

781
00:43:21.500 --> 00:43:22.500
Good. nice.

782
00:43:23.166 --> 00:43:24.250
That's it. you got it.

783
00:43:24.333 --> 00:43:25.833
-[Catolé hisses. grunts]
-[Toni] Yeah.

784
00:43:26.708 --> 00:43:27.708
[pained grunt]

785
00:43:28.500 --> 00:43:29.791
[grunts in pain]

786
00:43:30.416 --> 00:43:32.125
You good enough to fight. Catolé?

787
00:43:32.666 --> 00:43:34.583
All good. trust me. Coach. I'm fine.

788
00:43:34.666 --> 00:43:37.541
-You're fine. but can you fight. Catolé?
-[breathless] I can. Yes. I can.

789
00:43:37.625 --> 00:43:40.750
I just need good bandages
and to warm up real good.

790
00:43:40.833 --> 00:43:42.166
Trust me. Coach.

791
00:43:44.166 --> 00:43:45.750
[ominous music playing]

792
00:43:47.000 --> 00:43:48.250
[Toni yells]

793
00:43:53.291 --> 00:43:54.458
[Hammer] Are you good?

794
00:43:55.625 --> 00:43:56.666
[Toni exhales]

795
00:44:04.416 --> 00:44:05.333
[sighs]

796
00:44:09.041 --> 00:44:10.500
[crowd roars]

797
00:44:17.208 --> 00:44:19.416
-That got you good!
-I wanna bet. How do I do that?

798
00:44:19.500 --> 00:44:22.500
-You need cash. bro. that's all.
-Well. to be honest. I'm broke.

799
00:44:22.583 --> 00:44:24.166
You got a pretty nice watch.

800
00:44:24.666 --> 00:44:28.375
-Oh. yeah? Only valuable thing I got.
-I'll give you 300. Pays 3 to 1.

801
00:44:28.458 --> 00:44:30.333
-Alright. now get lost.
-Okay.

802
00:44:30.416 --> 00:44:31.666
Poor motherfucker.

803
00:44:32.208 --> 00:44:34.333
[intriguing music playing]

804
00:44:45.875 --> 00:44:47.208
[music fades]

805
00:44:49.541 --> 00:44:50.916
[ominous buzz]

806
00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:53.166
[frenzied music playing]

807
00:45:16.708 --> 00:45:17.583
[music stops]

808
00:45:18.291 --> 00:45:19.791
You sure. Stomper?

809
00:45:21.541 --> 00:45:23.458
Wagner's a big deal. you know.

810
00:45:24.291 --> 00:45:26.750
He's almost as experienced as you are.

811
00:45:26.833 --> 00:45:29.458
Thing is he's 15 years younger than you.

812
00:45:31.250 --> 00:45:32.750
It's a big risk.

813
00:45:32.833 --> 00:45:34.458
You with me or against me on this?

814
00:45:34.541 --> 00:45:35.583
Dude. I'm always with you.

815
00:45:35.666 --> 00:45:37.250
-Then act like it. damn it.
-Dad.

816
00:45:39.125 --> 00:45:40.291
What's going on?

817
00:45:40.875 --> 00:45:42.625
You know what's going on. Fights on.

818
00:45:42.708 --> 00:45:44.791
-Take 'em off.
-No. don't listen to her.

819
00:45:44.875 --> 00:45:46.291
-[Gabi] Take them off.
-Continue.

820
00:45:46.375 --> 00:45:48.291
-It's happening.
-Do it. Take those off!

821
00:45:48.375 --> 00:45:50.375
Yeah. if I don't fight. who will?

822
00:45:50.458 --> 00:45:53.208
[presenter] Representing Trindade Academy.

823
00:45:53.958 --> 00:45:59.083
Marcelo Lazarus!

824
00:45:59.166 --> 00:46:02.250
[pop music playing over loudspeakers]

825
00:46:06.458 --> 00:46:09.666
Wagner's real good.
He hits hard. he's strong.

826
00:46:09.750 --> 00:46:11.333
You gotta be patient. alright?

827
00:46:11.416 --> 00:46:14.625
Guard always up. protect your face.
Wait for the right moment.

828
00:46:14.708 --> 00:46:16.375
Just wait for it. Got it?

829
00:46:17.166 --> 00:46:18.625
Don't forget. kid.

830
00:46:18.708 --> 00:46:22.166
This is MMA. it's not street fighting.
Get in there.

831
00:46:22.250 --> 00:46:28.958
[presenter] And in the other corner.
Wagner…

832
00:46:29.041 --> 00:46:32.416
the Earthquake!

833
00:46:33.000 --> 00:46:35.208
[crowd roars]

834
00:46:35.291 --> 00:46:37.083
Yeah! Come on!

835
00:46:40.958 --> 00:46:42.500
[ref] You know the rules.

836
00:46:42.583 --> 00:46:45.583
Always follow my commands
and respect each other.

837
00:46:45.666 --> 00:46:47.000
Touch gloves now.

838
00:46:47.083 --> 00:46:48.125
To your corners.

839
00:46:49.750 --> 00:46:51.625
You ready? You ready?

840
00:46:51.708 --> 00:46:52.541
Now fight!

841
00:46:55.083 --> 00:46:58.041
You gotta move. Marcelo.
Gotta move. You're not a post. fuck.

842
00:47:00.875 --> 00:47:02.375
Keep your goddamned hands up!

843
00:47:02.458 --> 00:47:03.958
[spectator] Let's go! Yeah!

844
00:47:04.041 --> 00:47:05.083
[Toni] Raise your hands!

845
00:47:05.166 --> 00:47:06.083
Move. move. come on!

846
00:47:06.166 --> 00:47:08.083
[crowd chanting] Ooh. he'll kill you!

847
00:47:08.166 --> 00:47:09.833
[Toni] Keep your guard up.

848
00:47:10.833 --> 00:47:14.666
[chanting] Ooh. he'll kill you!
Ooh. he'll kill you!

849
00:47:14.750 --> 00:47:15.708
[Toni] Nice!

850
00:47:15.791 --> 00:47:17.250
Focus on the fight. Focus!

851
00:47:17.333 --> 00:47:18.541
[Hammer] Holy shit!

852
00:47:19.125 --> 00:47:21.583
-[Toni] Make some space!
-[coach] Make space. Wagner!

853
00:47:22.916 --> 00:47:23.958
That's it!

854
00:47:24.958 --> 00:47:26.750
[Toni] Dammit! Spin around.

855
00:47:26.833 --> 00:47:28.625
That's it! Now get up!

856
00:47:29.375 --> 00:47:31.708
We shouldn't have let him fight. Hammer.

857
00:47:31.791 --> 00:47:34.500
Come on. Marcelo! You gotta move more!
It's over for him. fuck.

858
00:47:35.125 --> 00:47:37.041
-[shrill buzzing]
-[Toni] Protect your head!

859
00:47:37.916 --> 00:47:39.208
You gotta do something. Wake up!

860
00:47:39.875 --> 00:47:41.291
[buzzing intensifies]

861
00:47:42.125 --> 00:47:43.375
[Gabi. muffled] Marcelo!

862
00:47:43.875 --> 00:47:45.541
Move. Marcelo!

863
00:47:46.041 --> 00:47:47.875
-[buzzing stops]
-[Wagner yells]

864
00:47:49.916 --> 00:47:51.541
[Hammer] Mount him! Yes!

865
00:47:51.625 --> 00:47:52.708
You got it!

866
00:47:53.708 --> 00:47:55.916
[Toni] Go. now! That's it. crush him!

867
00:47:56.000 --> 00:47:57.666
-[Hammer] Destroy him.
-[Toni] Keep working.

868
00:47:57.750 --> 00:48:01.625
[Hammer] It's now or never.
Marcelo! Hit him! Hit him!

869
00:48:01.708 --> 00:48:02.583
Yes. good.

870
00:48:02.666 --> 00:48:04.083
[Hammer] Yes. that's it!

871
00:48:04.958 --> 00:48:06.958
-[Toni] Don't let up.
-[Hammer] Crush him!

872
00:48:09.875 --> 00:48:11.333
[distorted growls]

873
00:48:11.416 --> 00:48:12.250
[shrill buzzing]

874
00:48:12.333 --> 00:48:13.958
-Stop. it's over!
-[ref] Stop!

875
00:48:14.583 --> 00:48:15.958
-Stop. stop!
-No!

876
00:48:18.333 --> 00:48:19.708
Get off!

877
00:48:19.791 --> 00:48:21.041
[Marcelo yells]

878
00:48:22.208 --> 00:48:24.333
It's over! Enough! Enough!

879
00:48:24.916 --> 00:48:26.083
It's over. Marcelo.

880
00:48:26.166 --> 00:48:28.375
-[Marcelo yells]
-[Toni] Fight's over. Marcelo.

881
00:48:28.458 --> 00:48:31.750
It's done. It's over. you hear? Hey. hey…

882
00:48:31.833 --> 00:48:33.875
It's over. All done.

883
00:48:33.958 --> 00:48:35.916
[tense music playing]

884
00:49:07.125 --> 00:49:08.250
[music fades]

885
00:49:09.833 --> 00:49:12.708
[closing theme music playing]

886
00:50:38.041 --> 00:50:39.541
[music stops]

886
00:50:40.305 --> 00:51:40.336
Do you want subtitles for any video?
